<title>USA: Bronson Schools, Mich., won by Southern Mich. Bank.</title>
<headline>Bronson Schools, Mich., won by Southern Mich. Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Michigan Bank, Coldwater said it won $1.650 million of Bronson Community School District, Mich., 1997 school building and site bonds with a net interest cost of 4.512 percent.</p>
</text>
